  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment provides strategic advisory support to RVO in strengthening the positioning and knowledge function of the Sustainable Water Fund (FDW). The consultancy contributes to analysing the programme&#x2019;s added value, developing key messages and policy briefs, and facilitating dialogue between FDW, the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and sector stakeholders. It also supports knowledge management, strategic events and discussions on the future direction of the programme and potential follow-up initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
